 "html": "<section class=\"section_hub-hero\" id=\"hero\" data-frame=\"launch-control\" aria-labelledby=\"heroTitle\"><span class=\"ab_frame-label\" data-frame-label=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▢ launch-control</span><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"ab_dbh is-hub\"><div class=\"ab_dbh_top\"><div class=\"ab_crumb text-style-mono\"><a class=\"ab_crumb_link\" href=\"/\">/home</a> / <span class=\"ab_crumb_current\">services</span></div><div class=\"ab_rec text-style-mono\"><span class=\"ab_rec_dot is-live\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>AB spaceport · pads open</div></div><div class=\"ab_planet is-dbh is-hub\" data-planet=\"gas\" data-seed=\"11\" data-colors=\"#0d2a66,#146EF5,#8fb8ff,#e8f0ff,#1d2350\" data-ring=\"#cfe0ff,#146EF5,#0d2a66\" data-tilt=\"-16\" data-spin=\"50\" data-glow=\"rgba(20,110,245,.4)\" data-drag=\"\" data-label=\"Go for launch · Website\" data-hub-planet=\"\"></div><div class=\"ab_hub-hero_grid\"><div class=\"ab_hub-hero_copy\"><div class=\"ab_dbh_eyebrow text-style-mono\">Services · <span data-hub-count=\"\">8</span> launches on the manifest</div><h1 class=\"ab_dbh_title is-hub\" id=\"heroTitle\"><span class=\"ab_dbh_word\">Launch</span> <span class=\"ab_dbh_word t-outline\">control</span></h1></div><p class=\"ab_dbh_sum is-hub\">Eight destinations, one pilot. Arm the launch your site needs and mission control prints your launch pass.</p></div><div class=\"ab_hub-sym\"><div class=\"ab_hub-sym_label\" id=\"hbSymL\"><span class=\"ab_hub-sym_dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Run diagnostics · what’s wrong right now?</div><div class=\"ab_hub-sym_chips\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"hbSymL\" data-hub-chips=\"\"><div class=\"ab_chip is-diag is-reset\" data-diag=\"-1\">All clear</div></div></div><div class=\"ab_hub-board\" data-hub-board=\"\"><div class=\"ab_mc is-hub\"><div class=\"ab_mon is-hub\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Monitor / launch manifest\" data-hub-mon=\"\"><div class=\"ab_mon_bar text-style-mono\"><span class=\"ab_mon_rec\">Live · <span class=\"ab_hub-wide\">launch </span>manifest</span><span class=\"ab_mon_tc\"><span data-hub-clock=\"\">--:--</span> <span data-bind=\"tz-label\">ET</span><span class=\"ab_hub-wide\"> · <span data-hub-count=\"\">8</span> launches</span></span></div><div class=\"ab_screen is-hub\" data-hub-screen=\"\"><div class=\"ab_hub-scr\" data-hub-rows=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"ab_mon_cap\"><span class=\"ab_hub-prompt\" data-hub-prompt=\"\">&gt; Click a launch to print its pass</span><span class=\"text-style-mono\">AB-OS 2.6</span></div><div class=\"ab_hub-slot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ab_hub-slot_line\"></span><span class=\"ab_hub-slot_label\">Pass printer</span></div></div><div class=\"ab_console is-hub\"><div class=\"ab_panel\"><div class=\"ab_panel_h text-style-mono\"><span>Launch keys</span><span>01–<span data-hub-count2=\"\">08</span></span></div><div class=\"ab_hub-keys\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Arm a launch\" data-hub-keys=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"ab_panel\"><div class=\"ab_panel_h text-style-mono\"><span>Telemetry</span><span data-tele=\"n\">AB-01</span></div><div class=\"ab_tele\"><div class=\"ab_tele_item\"><span class=\"ab_tele_k\">Destination</span><span class=\"ab_tele_v\" data-tele=\"d\">WFD</span></div><div class=\"ab_tele_item\"><span class=\"ab_tele_k\">Orbit</span><span class=\"ab_tele_v\" data-tele=\"o\">GAS</span></div><div class=\"ab_tele_item\"><span class=\"ab_tele_k\">Transfers</span><span class=\"ab_tele_v\" data-tele=\"t\">2</span></div><div class=\"ab_tele_item\"><span class=\"ab_tele_k\">Status</span><span class=\"ab_tele_v is-ok\" data-tele=\"s\">GO</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ab_hub-print\" data-hub-print=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"><article class=\"ab_hub-pass\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Slate / launch-pass\" data-hub-pass=\"\"><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_main\"><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_top\"><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_ok\">Cleared for launch</span><span>Launch pass · <span class=\"ab_hub-pass_b\" data-pass=\"flight\">AB-01</span></span></div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_route\"><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_end\"><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_small\">Launch site</span><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_code\">EARTH</span></div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_arc\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_dash\"></span><div class=\"ab_planet is-pass\" data-planet=\"gas\" data-seed=\"80\" data-colors=\"#0d2a66,#146EF5,#8fb8ff,#e8f0ff,#1d2350\" data-ring=\"#cfe0ff,#146EF5,#0d2a66\" data-tilt=\"-16\" data-spin=\"50\" data-glow=\"rgba(20,110,245,.4)\" data-pass=\"planet\"></div><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_dash\"></span></div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_end is-to\"><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_small\">Destination</span><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_code is-to\" data-pass=\"code\">WFD</span></div></div><a class=\"ab_hub-pass_link\" href=\"/services/webflow-development\" data-pass=\"link\"><h2 class=\"ab_hub-pass_title\" data-pass=\"title\"><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_t1\">Webflow</span> <span class=\"ab_hub-pass_t2 t-outline\">development</span></h2><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_open\">Open service →</span></a><p class=\"ab_hub-pass_sum\" data-pass=\"sum\">Sites your team can actually edit. Planned, designed in Figma and built in Webflow from the ground up, with clean classes, a CMS that makes sense and motion that survives a copy edit.</p><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_facts\"><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_fact\"><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_k\">Crew seat</div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_v\" data-pass=\"best\">Marketing sites, portfolios, studios</div></div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_fact\"><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_k\">Orbit class</div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_v\" data-pass=\"orbit\">Gas giant</div></div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_fact\"><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_k\">Transfers</div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_v\" data-pass=\"via\">CMS sync · Motion</div></div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_fact\"><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_k\">Payload</div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_v\">6 deliverables · 4 stages</div></div></div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_tools\" data-pass=\"tools\"><span class=\"ab_chip is-tool\">Webflow</span><span class=\"ab_chip is-tool\">Client-First</span><span class=\"ab_chip is-tool\">GSAP</span><span class=\"ab_chip is-tool\">Figma</span></div></div><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_stub\"><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_stub-t\">Service briefing</span><div class=\"ab_hub-pass_qr\" data-pass=\"qr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_stub-f\"><span class=\"ab_hub-pass_stub-code\" data-pass=\"code2\">WFD</span> · <span data-pass=\"flight2\">AB-01</span></span><a class=\"button is-primary is-stub\" href=\"/services/webflow-development\" data-magnetic=\"\" data-pass=\"stub\"><span class=\"ab_button-shine\"></span><span class=\"ab_button-label\">Explore service</span><span class=\"ab_button-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></article></div></div></div></div></section>",
 "css": ".section_hub-hero{position:relative;z-index:4}\n.ab_dbh.is-hub{padding-bottom:0}\n.ab_planet.is-dbh.is-hub{left:auto;right:clamp(10px,7vw,130px);top:clamp(170px,14vw,230px);width:clamp(130px,16vw,260px);z-index:2}\n.ab_hub-hero_grid{position:relative;z-index:4;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);grid-row-gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px);grid-column-gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}\n.ab_hub-hero_copy{position:relative;min-width:0}\n.ab_dbh_title.is-hub{font-size:clamp(52px,8.6vw,150px)}\n.ab_dbh_sum.is-hub{max-width:44ch;margin-top:0;justify-self:start}\n.ab_hub-sym{position:relative;z-index:4;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;grid-row-gap:12px;grid-column-gap:20px;margin-top:clamp(32px,4.5vw,56px)}\n.ab_hub-sym_label{display:inline-flex;flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:0;flex-basis:auto;align-items:center;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---brand--signal)}\n.ab_hub-sym_dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-top-left-radius:50%;border-top-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-left-radius:50%;background-color:#ff4d3a}\n.ab_hub-sym_chips{display:flex;flex-grow:1;flex-shrink:1;flex-basis:0%;flex-wrap:wrap;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:8px;min-width:0}\n.ab_chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:8px;padding-top:8px;padding-right:11px;padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:11px;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--_color---text--secondary);cursor:pointer}\n.ab_chip:hover{border-top-color:var(--_color---text--primary);border-right-color:var(--_color---text--primary);border-bottom-color:var(--_color---text--primary);border-left-color:var(--_color---text--primary);color:var(--_color---text--primary)}\n.ab_chip.is-diag{background-color:transparent}\n.ab_chip.is-diag.is-reset{border-top-style:dashed;border-right-style:dashed;border-bottom-style:dashed;border-left-style:dashed;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em}\n.ab_hub-board{position:relative;margin-top:clamp(18px,2vw,26px)}\n.ab_mc.is-hub{z-index:2}\n.ab_mon.is-hub{z-index:2}\n.ab_hub-wide{position:relative}\n.ab_screen.is-hub{aspect-ratio:auto;color:var(--_color---text--primary)}\n.ab_hub-scr{position:relative;z-index:2;padding-top:48px;padding-right:clamp(10px,1.4vw,18px);padding-bottom:clamp(14px,1.6vw,20px);padding-left:clamp(10px,1.4vw,18px)}\n.ab_hub-prompt{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--secondary)}\n.ab_hub-slot{position:relative;height:14px;margin-top:12px;margin-right:10%;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:10%;background-color:#030305}\n.ab_hub-slot_line{position:absolute;left:10%;right:10%;top:6px;height:2px;background-color:var(--_color---brand--signal);opacity:0}\n.ab_hub-slot_label{position:absolute;right:0;top:-16px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_console.is-hub{position:relative}\n.ab_hub-keys{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-row-gap:4px;grid-column-gap:4px}\n.ab_hub-print{position:relative;z-index:6;margin-top:-4px}\n.ab_hub-pass{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) clamp(200px,18vw,240px);width:78%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);color:var(--_color---text--primary)}\n.ab_hub-pass_main{position:relative;padding-top:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-right:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-bottom:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-left:clamp(18px,2vw,26px)}\n.ab_hub-pass_top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;grid-row-gap:10px;grid-column-gap:10px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_hub-pass_ok{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;grid-row-gap:7px;grid-column-gap:7px;color:var(--_color---status--live)}\n.ab_hub-pass_b{color:var(--_color---text--primary);font-weight:500}\n.ab_hub-pass_route{display:flex;align-items:center;grid-row-gap:clamp(10px,1.4vw,18px);grid-column-gap:clamp(10px,1.4vw,18px);margin-top:clamp(12px,1.6vw,18px)}\n.ab_hub-pass_end{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.1}\n.ab_hub-pass_small{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_hub-pass_code{margin-top:4px;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,42px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.01em}\n.ab_hub-pass_arc{display:flex;flex-grow:1;flex-shrink:1;flex-basis:0%;align-items:center;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:8px;min-width:60px}\n.ab_hub-pass_dash{flex-grow:1;flex-shrink:1;flex-basis:0%;height:0;border-top-width:1.5px;border-top-style:dashed;border-top-color:rgba(242,240,234,0.35)}\n.ab_planet.is-pass{position:relative;left:auto;right:auto;top:auto;flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:0;flex-basis:auto;width:clamp(44px,4.4vw,64px)}\n.ab_hub-pass_link{position:relative;display:block;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n.ab_hub-pass_title{margin-top:clamp(14px,1.8vw,20px);margin-bottom:0;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,40px);font-weight:900;line-height:0.92;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.ab_hub-pass_t1{display:block}\n.ab_hub-pass_t2{display:block}\n.ab_hub-pass_open{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_hub-pass_sum{max-width:62ch;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--_color---text--secondary)}\n.ab_hub-pass_facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));grid-row-gap:1px;grid-column-gap:1px;margin-top:16px;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08)}\n.ab_hub-pass_fact{padding-top:9px;padding-right:11px;padding-bottom:9px;padding-left:11px;background-color:rgba(7,8,13,0.45)}\n.ab_hub-pass_k{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_hub-pass_v{margin-top:3px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3}\n.ab_hub-pass_tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;grid-row-gap:6px;grid-column-gap:6px;margin-top:14px}\n.ab_chip.is-tool{padding-top:4px;padding-right:8px;padding-bottom:4px;padding-left:8px;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);border-right-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);border-left-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:default}\n.ab_hub-pass_stub{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;grid-row-gap:10px;grid-column-gap:10px;padding-top:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-right:clamp(16px,1.6vw,22px);padding-bottom:clamp(18px,2vw,26px);padding-left:clamp(16px,1.6vw,22px);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:dashed;border-left-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);background-color:rgba(7,8,13,0.3)}\n.ab_hub-pass_stub-t{margin-top:14px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_hub-pass_qr{display:block;width:100%;max-width:150px;aspect-ratio:1;padding-top:8px;padding-right:8px;padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:8px;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);background-color:rgba(242,240,234,0.06)}\n.ab_hub-pass_stub-f{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_hub-pass_stub-code{font-weight:600}\n.button.is-primary.is-stub{width:100%;margin-top:auto;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:12px;padding-right:14px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:14px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.04em;white-space:nowrap}\n@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n.ab_planet.is-dbh.is-hub{right:-24px;top:118px;width:120px}\n.ab_dbh_title.is-hub{font-size:clamp(52px,17vw,96px)}\n.ab_hub-sym{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}\n.ab_hub-keys{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.ab_hub-pass{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);width:94%}\n.ab_hub-slot{margin-left:3%;margin-right:3%}\n.ab_planet.is-pass{width:40px}\n}\n"
}